# The README's GIF: a real /proob:try in Claude Code on python-semver, one commit before the
# fix for issue #497. Run tools/demo/record.sh, not this file directly.
Output target/demo/raw.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Set Padding 24
Hide
Type "source tools/demo/env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "claude"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "/proob:try"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Hide
Sleep 9m
Show
Screenshot target/demo/final.png
Sleep 16s
